{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-fleet/tests/postgres.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-27T22:15:47.944539Z","id":"3e878bdbfa061840541a63d7ffbdde07d3bc46cd8da92c32838f6a64375ec149","body":{"detail":"Every test here is ignored without CLAX_TEST_PG_URL, and none was run when the PostgreSQL backend was written: the SQL of crates/clax-fleet/src/coord.rs (PgCoordinator), pages.rs, content.rs and pg.rs (migrate, Fence::check) is checked only by compiling. Run `CLAX_TEST_PG_URL=postgresql://... just fleet-pg-test` before relying on the backend.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1},"end":{"line":6},"content_hash":"60daf0c695e6bb08c729a3ef1c3632bb363fbe36ce1cfd02c39f086c773b42bf"},"summary":"The PostgreSQL tests have not run against a server on this branch","tags":["test-coverage","session:claude-code:52195316-c20b-49ba-9ad3-4026c7d5a1e0"]}}
